<title>JAPAN: Kobe Rubber to help set up Thai commodity exchange.</title>
<headline>Kobe Rubber to help set up Thai commodity exchange.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kobe Rubber Exchange has agreed with Thailand's Ministry of Agriculture and Cooperatives to help set up a commodity futures exchange to list a natural rubber futures contract in Thailand, an exchange official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The exchange would be Thailand's first commodity futures exchange.</p>
<p>A Thai government delegation visited the Kobe Rubber Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are expected to provide know-how to help Thailand set up the exchange to launch a natural rubber futures contract,&quot; the exchange official said.</p>
<p>The official said the Thai government hopes to set up the exchange by November.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
